Group gGarageDoorOpeners

Switch Large_Garagedoor_Opener (gGarageDoorOpeners)
Switch Small_Garagedoor_Opener (gGarageDoorOpeners)

// Platzhalter-Kanal-UIDs: <binding-id>:<thing-type-id>:<thing-id>:<channel-id>
// an das eigene Binding/Thing anpassen!
Switch Large_Garagedoor_Opener_Linked { channel="example:device:largedoor:opener" }
Switch Small_Garagedoor_Opener_Linked { channel="example:device:smalldoor:opener" }

Switch GarageControllerComputer
Switch GarageControllerService
String AlertItem
